a bash/POSIX-compatible shell in Rust by Reuben Olinsky. The crates
`brush-core`, `brush-parser`, `brush-builtins`, `brush-interactive`,
`brush-shell`, `brush-coreutils-builtins` and `brush-test-harness`, and the
`xtask` build tooling, originate there and have been modified.

